    "insertDiagram": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "A clean, stylized figure Inky composes as SVG code: biology/physics/general diagrams, labeled schematics, flowcharts, cycles, energy diagrams, timelines. The app renders it with Inky's style kit, fits it, checks text for overlaps and puts it on the page. Prefer `draw` for quick handwritten sketches and `insertGraphCard` for plots of functions.",
